{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1773367331_6214234_d85207cad1316231752d750ba63c5b51.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">About Our Brand and Products:</span></strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Faithful Champions is faith-based sports apparel — compression shirts, grip socks, shin pads, and more — designed for real competition with bold messages like \"Jesus Saves\" and \"Fear God.\" 10% of all proceeds go to charity each month.</span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>What Makes Us Different:</strong></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">FC was created because high-performance Christian athletic apparel didn't exist. Every product is built for game day while letting athletes plant seeds on their team. Trusted by professional and collegiate athletes across multiple sports.</span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn:</strong></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Earn 15% commission on every sale through your personal code or link. Your followers get 15% off their order — everyone wins.</span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>How to Promote Us:</strong></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Share your code on Instagram, TikTok, and game day content. Wear FC in training and tag @faithful.champions. Share with teammates and your circle.</span></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Other Information:</strong></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\">This is more than an affiliate program — it's a ministry. We're looking for athletes and believers who live out their faith and want to inspire others. God's Glory. Your Grind.</span></p></div>",
